Pick how strongly the keys buzz — and see what a press did

Vibration strength: Light, Medium or Strong. Tap a level to feel it. Light is unchanged, so nothing changes unless you choose it. Many e-ink phones cannot vary intensity, so the stronger levels are longer too.

New switch: Confirm actions on screen. Do Not Disturb, the flashlight, media controls and custom broadcasts say what they did. Off by default, and deliberately silent for scrolling and page turns.
